(4173505, 601095, 77192, '<td valign="top">color balance is a little magenta and it could be sharper.</td>', 'color balance is a little magenta and it could be sharper.', '2007-10-17 01:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173506, 601036, 32872, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a pencil under a microscope?  Reminds me of a Staligtite (SP?)  from a cave.  Cool image.</td>', 'Wow, this is a pencil under a microscope?  Reminds me of a Staligtite (SP?)  from a cave.  Cool image.', '2007-10-17 01:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173511, 600580, 78303, '<td valign="top">Funny!  There are several of us with this same thought out there.</td>', 'Funny!  There are several of us with this same thought out there.', '2007-10-17 01:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173514, 600870, 32872, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and peaceful image.  Love the soft tones....nice and simple!!  Really tranquile.  And you used pencils? Unbelievable!! 10</td>', 'Beautiful and peaceful image.  Love the soft tones....nice and simple!!  Really tranquile.  And you used pencils? Unbelievable!! 10', '2007-10-17 01:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173552, 601073, 68573, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, beautiful and so nicely executed</td>', 'Wonderful, beautiful and so nicely executed', '2007-10-17 01:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173569, 599069, 66494, '<td valign="top">Very creative. 8</td>', 'Very creative. 8', '2007-10-17 01:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173575, 599003, 53316, '<td valign="top">You made it fit in so well that I had to search really hard to find the pencil.  I like it, but I''m afraid people might not spend the time looking. Good luck.  Oh ps, love the bright background :-)</td>', 'You made it fit in so well that I had to search really hard to find the pencil.  I like it, but I''m afraid people might not spend the time looking. Good luck.  Oh ps, love the bright background :-)', '2007-10-17 01:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173576, 601073, 66494, '<td valign="top">Very creative and very well done. 9</td>', 'Very creative and very well done. 9', '2007-10-17 01:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173580, 600721, 57032, '<td valign="top">One could argue that--based on the title--the subject of this image is the pencil. However, the wording of the title makes the bird the subject (<b>I</b> haven''t seen ..."), and things get even worse if you go solely by the image (there''s no pencil at all).<br/> <br/>With that aside, the image has nice colours, good contrast, and is composed fairly well. The expressions and timing are nice, but it''s not the most exciting image.</td>', 'One could argue that--based on the title--the subject of this image is the pencil. However, the wording of the title makes the bird the subject (I haven''t seen ..."), and things get even worse if you go solely by the image (there''s no pencil at all). With that aside, the image has nice colours, good contrast, and is composed fairly well. The expressions and timing are nice, but it''s not the most exciting image.', '2007-10-17 01:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173582, 601056, 53316, '<td valign="top">A levels or curves adjustment would have helped I think. Composition is very nice.</td>', 'A levels or curves adjustment would have helped I think. Composition is very nice.', '2007-10-17 01:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173584, 600945, 53316, '<td valign="top">Nice... kinda like an abstract but also very recognizable too.</td>', 'Nice... kinda like an abstract but also very recognizable too.', '2007-10-17 01:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173587, 601019, 53316, '<td valign="top">LOL, the parents are falling over... maybe they''ve been drinking to celebrate? ;-)  Cute picture, I like it :-)</td>', 'LOL, the parents are falling over... maybe they''ve been drinking to celebrate? ;-)  Cute picture, I like it :-)', '2007-10-17 01:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173591, 600809, 53316, '<td valign="top">Very dark and moody; I like that.</td>', 'Very dark and moody; I like that.', '2007-10-17 01:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173593, 600014, 57032, '<td valign="top">Image could''ve been bigger. The pencil would have been better placed a bit to the left, and the image could''ve been composed so the extension of the pencil was not visible. There are too many things that needed to be done to improve this image.</td>', 'Image could''ve been bigger. The pencil would have been better placed a bit to the left, and the image could''ve been composed so the extension of the pencil was not visible. There are too many things that needed to be done to improve this image.', '2007-10-17 01:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173598, 601017, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m so glad that you had two of the pencils already in the wood. Makes it way more believable to me!</td>', 'Wow, I''m so glad that you had two of the pencils already in the wood. Makes it way more believable to me!', '2007-10-17 01:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173605, 600231, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and I like the lighting.  Be careful with the details, though - a bit of the branch is visible on the other side of the pencil.</td>', 'Nice idea and I like the lighting.  Be careful with the details, though - a bit of the branch is visible on the other side of the pencil.', '2007-10-17 01:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173607, 600951, 53316, '<td valign="top">It''s abstract, yes, but it''s still functioning as a pencil, in my view.  Anyway, really nice colors and composition.</td>', 'It''s abstract, yes, but it''s still functioning as a pencil, in my view.  Anyway, really nice colors and composition.', '2007-10-17 01:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173609, 601027, 81664, '<td valign="top">wow, that is a lot of water splashing around! <br/> <br/>What a great idea! very cute and clever!</td>', 'wow, that is a lot of water splashing around!  What a great idea! very cute and clever!', '2007-10-17 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173610, 600815, 57032, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like how the stamp on the pencil is visible, but I figure it was a conscious decision to avoid ridiculous DNMC claims.<br/> <br/>Nice colours and good contrast. Composition is good, but the perspective could''ve been a bit more interesting.</td>', 'I don''t really like how the stamp on the pencil is visible, but I figure it was a conscious decision to avoid ridiculous DNMC claims. Nice colours and good contrast. Composition is good, but the perspective could''ve been a bit more interesting.', '2007-10-17 01:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173613, 601172, 53316, '<td valign="top">Awww, how adorable!!!!! I had pet mice and I just love little rodent pets.. so cute! The picture is good although it might have been better to have the walls be the same color.  Thanks for making me smile!!</td>', 'Awww, how adorable!!!!! I had pet mice and I just love little rodent pets.. so cute! The picture is good although it might have been better to have the walls be the same color.  Thanks for making me smile!!', '2007-10-17 01:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173615, 601114, 57032, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, perspective, and focus on the eraser. B&amp;W is great, too.</td>', 'I like the composition, perspective, and focus on the eraser. B&W is great, too.', '2007-10-17 01:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173620, 601073, 57032, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. It has me wondering what you did! Nice job.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. It has me wondering what you did! Nice job.', '2007-10-17 01:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173621, 601095, 53316, '<td valign="top">A levels or curves adjustment would have helped this a lot. However, I really think it is a great concept and very cutely executed, as well.</td>', 'A levels or curves adjustment would have helped this a lot. However, I really think it is a great concept and very cutely executed, as well.', '2007-10-17 01:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173624, 600721, 60862, '<td valign="top">DNMC, low contrast, and looks like a quick snapshot stuffed into whatever challenge happened to be underway.</td>', 'DNMC, low contrast, and looks like a quick snapshot stuffed into whatever challenge happened to be underway.', '2007-10-17 01:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173625, 600805, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great composition, excellent exposure and contrast, and the title is perfect (great reference!). The slight smoke is a perfect touch to bump it to a 10 from me.</td>', 'Great composition, excellent exposure and contrast, and the title is perfect (great reference!). The slight smoke is a perfect touch to bump it to a 10 from me.', '2007-10-17 01:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173629, 600721, 50231, '<td valign="top">Classic! :-P</td>', 'Classic! :-P', '2007-10-17 01:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173630, 600723, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic lighting. Good job of controlling the highlights.</td>', 'Nice dramatic lighting. Good job of controlling the highlights.', '2007-10-17 01:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173632, 600790, 53316, '<td valign="top">What''s the pencil functioning as? It''s still just a pencil to me.  In any case, I love the composition and the contrast, and I like the dual "over-sharpening" meaning - you executed that nicely.</td>', 'What''s the pencil functioning as? It''s still just a pencil to me.  In any case, I love the composition and the contrast, and I like the dual "over-sharpening" meaning - you executed that nicely.', '2007-10-17 01:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173633, 601044, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Good take on the challenge. Bokeh is nice, and I agree with your decision to blur out the archer.</td>', 'Great perspective. Good take on the challenge. Bokeh is nice, and I agree with your decision to blur out the archer.', '2007-10-17 01:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173637, 600624, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great colours, and an excellent interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Great colours, and an excellent interpretation of the challenge.', '2007-10-17 01:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173639, 600231, 42013, '<td valign="top">Seems like something soup or Techo might do... I applaud your creativity.</td>', 'Seems like something soup or Techo might do... I applaud your creativity.', '2007-10-17 01:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4173640, 600896, 57032, '<td valign="top">I like the sharp detail, and appreciate the fact that the background isn''t entirely black (which would make the pencil look like it was just floating).</td>', 'I like the sharp detail, and appreciate the fact that the background isn''t entirely black (which would make the pencil look like it was just floating).', '2007-10-17 01:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
