(4174370, 600014, 38032, '<td valign="top">Good eye. I''m going to guess that you get some comments about the image size.  Personally, I like it in a serendipitous way that fits this subject: A found correlation between 2 everyday objects and nothing more.  The title is of course - a perfect match for it all.</td>', 'Good eye. I''m going to guess that you get some comments about the image size.  Personally, I like it in a serendipitous way that fits this subject: A found correlation between 2 everyday objects and nothing more.  The title is of course - a perfect match for it all.', '2007-10-17 08:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174371, 600113, 38032, '<td valign="top">A clever spin - many people chose chop-sticks -- adding the extrra elememnts pushes it into a new genre.</td>', 'A clever spin - many people chose chop-sticks -- adding the extrra elememnts pushes it into a new genre.', '2007-10-17 08:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
