(4174388, 601244, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like that the dude has some chainsaw or something- which suits the look on his face. The lighting is nice and dramatic. I''m thinkin it might be cooler if the 2''s were''t there right in front of the face (making it more subtle).  I''d also take a look at the histogram-  could use brightening in the midtones IMO.</td>', 'I like that the dude has some chainsaw or something- which suits the look on his face. The lighting is nice and dramatic. I''m thinkin it might be cooler if the 2''s were''t there right in front of the face (making it more subtle).  I''d also take a look at the histogram-  could use brightening in the midtones IMO.', '2007-10-17 08:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174395, 599158, 38032, '<td valign="top">The added wind makes this extra humourous.  I''d love to see an extra pencil-ish element here ... maybe if makeup was "penciled" on or maybe eraser barrettes or something.  Very cool though. 7</td>', 'The added wind makes this extra humourous.  I''d love to see an extra pencil-ish element here ... maybe if makeup was "penciled" on or maybe eraser barrettes or something.  Very cool though. 7', '2007-10-17 08:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
