(4174714, 601202, 44825, '<td valign="top">AARRGGHH!!!!! - Mind you it''s only a Canon!:)</td>', 'AARRGGHH!!!!! - Mind you it''s only a Canon!:)', '2007-10-17 10:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174717, 600076, 84640, '<td valign="top">Sick!</td>', 'Sick!', '2007-10-17 10:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174729, 599003, 66414, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to figure this photo out, but now I have its a great creative photo.  The pencil is well hidden and the fact that you can see the wording on the pencil and its ''messy hair cut'' bothing giving away its identity is nicely juxtaposed to the brushes.  I would have opted for a different background though. Regardless, well done.</td>', 'It took me a minute to figure this photo out, but now I have its a great creative photo.  The pencil is well hidden and the fact that you can see the wording on the pencil and its ''messy hair cut'' bothing giving away its identity is nicely juxtaposed to the brushes.  I would have opted for a different background though. Regardless, well done.', '2007-10-17 10:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174736, 601051, 66414, '<td valign="top">After seeing the numerous shots of chopsticks I was getting sick of them, however this photo does work well because of the colours and placement of the items.  A good still life shot.</td>', 'After seeing the numerous shots of chopsticks I was getting sick of them, however this photo does work well because of the colours and placement of the items.  A good still life shot.', '2007-10-17 10:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174741, 599076, 66414, '<td valign="top">The pencil is not as in focus as I would have liked seeing it is the subject in the shot.</td>', 'The pencil is not as in focus as I would have liked seeing it is the subject in the shot.', '2007-10-17 10:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174752, 601247, 66414, '<td valign="top">Nice creative idea.  My only change would be to boost the levels to make the background white, not grey.  Perhaps opening up a stop would work better.</td>', 'Nice creative idea.  My only change would be to boost the levels to make the background white, not grey.  Perhaps opening up a stop would work better.', '2007-10-17 10:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174755, 600829, 85383, '<td valign="top">underexposed; needs more contrast; try in color</td>', 'underexposed; needs more contrast; try in color', '2007-10-17 10:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174756, 601228, 85383, '<td valign="top">I tried this with no luck. Glad to see you pulled it off. Though I''m not crazy about the shadows.</td>', 'I tried this with no luck. Glad to see you pulled it off. Though I''m not crazy about the shadows.', '2007-10-17 10:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174759, 599211, 66414, '<td valign="top">Thats a new and effective idea from a pencil.  It''s good to see not all thoughts of what a pencil can be used for is only chopsticks!  I like it, my only change would be to brighten it up a bit more and add a bit more DOF to get the outlier pencil just slightly more in focus.</td>', 'Thats a new and effective idea from a pencil.  It''s good to see not all thoughts of what a pencil can be used for is only chopsticks!  I like it, my only change would be to brighten it up a bit more and add a bit more DOF to get the outlier pencil just slightly more in focus.', '2007-10-17 10:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174760, 600951, 85383, '<td valign="top">I love the photo, but what is it saying the pencil is?</td>', 'I love the photo, but what is it saying the pencil is?', '2007-10-17 10:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174762, 600870, 85383, '<td valign="top">Ok, so my idea wasn''t very creative or original since this is the third one like it. I didn''t have the right tools without going out and spending money. Yours is the best "chopsticks" so far. I love the lighting.</td>', 'Ok, so my idea wasn''t very creative or original since this is the third one like it. I didn''t have the right tools without going out and spending money. Yours is the best "chopsticks" so far. I love the lighting.', '2007-10-17 10:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174766, 599104, 85383, '<td valign="top">Ok, ok, enough chopsticks. But this one is awesome.</td>', 'Ok, ok, enough chopsticks. But this one is awesome.', '2007-10-17 10:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174767, 599047, 66414, '<td valign="top">Good composition and detail on this shot.</td>', 'Good composition and detail on this shot.', '2007-10-17 10:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4174770, 601008, 85383, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if you focused in on one bowl. The pencils could have helped you create an interesting composition.</td>', 'I think this would have been better if you focused in on one bowl. The pencils could have helped you create an interesting composition.', '2007-10-17 10:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
