(4175762, 600641, 59200, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea, I wish there was more contrast in the image though. The background could be more black and the highlights lighter.</td>', 'I really like this idea, I wish there was more contrast in the image though. The background could be more black and the highlights lighter.', '2007-10-17 14:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4175766, 601044, 59200, '<td valign="top">love this composition. You did a great job with the depth of field in the distance. It looks like your pencil point might have been a little out of focus still and you over corrected in your post processesing though. Otherwise, I think this would have been my top pick!</td>', 'love this composition. You did a great job with the depth of field in the distance. It looks like your pencil point might have been a little out of focus still and you over corrected in your post processesing though. Otherwise, I think this would have been my top pick!', '2007-10-17 15:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4175770, 599267, 59200, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here. I think maybe it would have been better in profile? I think right now her face and eyes take too much away from the pencils and hair as the focus of the picture.</td>', 'I like your idea here. I think maybe it would have been better in profile? I think right now her face and eyes take too much away from the pencils and hair as the focus of the picture.', '2007-10-17 15:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4175772, 599788, 32872, '<td valign="top">This is a winner in my book!! (sorry)  How clever, yet so everyday! We all use pencils as a bookmark.  You chose the perfect book and pencil, and placed them beautifully.  I love the vibrant colors, DOF and fabulous detail. This image reminds me of being a kid!! Really, this needs to be some sort of promotional poster for schools.<br/> <br/>A complete 10 from me.</td>', 'This is a winner in my book!! (sorry)  How clever, yet so everyday! We all use pencils as a bookmark.  You chose the perfect book and pencil, and placed them beautifully.  I love the vibrant colors, DOF and fabulous detail. This image reminds me of being a kid!! Really, this needs to be some sort of promotional poster for schools. A complete 10 from me.', '2007-10-17 15:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
