(4175850, 601051, 32872, '<td valign="top">Nice, elegant and tasteful!  The soft lighting really adds to this exotic image.  Nice job with the detail and cropping, too.   Cool.. the plate has an optical allusion going on in the corners!</td>', 'Nice, elegant and tasteful!  The soft lighting really adds to this exotic image.  Nice job with the detail and cropping, too.   Cool.. the plate has an optical allusion going on in the corners!', '2007-10-17 15:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4175855, 601172, 85500, '<td valign="top">I think there is a lot of creativity and work behind this picture. But this is not a creativity contest. It is all about the picture.<br/> <br/>The composition is not bad, but the lighting is extremely flat. From the shadows in the picture, I suspect the use of flash. If this had been done with a softer flash, a fill light and a reflector or two, the quality of the picture would have been lifted dramatically.<br/> <br/>Also, the background in this picture could have been made a bit more interesting. It is a shame to put so much work in a part of the picture and not go the whole distance.</td>', 'I think there is a lot of creativity and work behind this picture. But this is not a creativity contest. It is all about the picture. The composition is not bad, but the lighting is extremely flat. From the shadows in the picture, I suspect the use of flash. If this had been done with a softer flash, a fill light and a reflector or two, the quality of the picture would have been lifted dramatically. Also, the background in this picture could have been made a bit more interesting. It is a shame to put so much work in a part of the picture and not go the whole distance.', '2007-10-17 15:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4175856, 601050, 85156, '<td valign="top">I like your DOF, very creative idea.  Good composition and lighting.</td>', 'I like your DOF, very creative idea.  Good composition and lighting.', '2007-10-17 15:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4175860, 599574, 32872, '<td valign="top">I like your DOF and the shiny pencils.  I think your pencils would look better if they were sharper though.</td>', 'I like your DOF and the shiny pencils.  I think your pencils would look better if they were sharper though.', '2007-10-17 15:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4175866, 600893, 85500, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well done. Would have loved to see a little more "punch" in the picture. Maybe the a slight change of the angle of the light would have done it?</td>', 'Great idea and well done. Would have loved to see a little more "punch" in the picture. Maybe the a slight change of the angle of the light would have done it?', '2007-10-17 15:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
