(4176011, 601008, 84670, '<td valign="top">I love how the bowl is the only thing in this photo that is not composed of pencils, I didn''t notice until now and I give major props to the creativity, considering everyone chose to use the pencil as chopsticks in this challenge, you definately gave it an edge...</td>', 'I love how the bowl is the only thing in this photo that is not composed of pencils, I didn''t notice until now and I give major props to the creativity, considering everyone chose to use the pencil as chopsticks in this challenge, you definately gave it an edge...', '2007-10-17 16:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
