(4176018, 599267, 84656, '<td valign="top">Composition is great.  Colours have been well chosen.  Great big smile and some thought put into the tiara placement.  For me it''s original and meets the challenge.  Lighting is a tad harsh.  Biggest let down is the eye''s. For portraits the eye''s need to be pinsharp.</td>', 'Composition is great.  Colours have been well chosen.  Great big smile and some thought put into the tiara placement.  For me it''s original and meets the challenge.  Lighting is a tad harsh.  Biggest let down is the eye''s. For portraits the eye''s need to be pinsharp.', '2007-10-17 16:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4176019, 600721, 84670, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this signifies. It ate the pencil? Hence why it can''t bend it''s neck? Not Very clear.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this signifies. It ate the pencil? Hence why it can''t bend it''s neck? Not Very clear.', '2007-10-17 16:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
