(4177023, 601031, 41675, '<td valign="top">Tee hee hee. Too funny. I love squirrels and this photo cracks me up. I don''t even mind the blurry foreground. Rofl. Thanks for the smile.</td>', 'Tee hee hee. Too funny. I love squirrels and this photo cracks me up. I don''t even mind the blurry foreground. Rofl. Thanks for the smile.', '2007-10-17 23:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177027, 601051, 41675, '<td valign="top">An esthetically (sp) pleasing photo. Well balanced composition and lighting. This should do quite well. Good luck.</td>', 'An esthetically (sp) pleasing photo. Well balanced composition and lighting. This should do quite well. Good luck.', '2007-10-17 23:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177032, 599887, 41675, '<td valign="top">Simple, but I like it. Creative too. Good balance. I like the use of the black, gray and white pencils. I predict this will be in the top three (or it should be). Good luck!</td>', 'Simple, but I like it. Creative too. Good balance. I like the use of the black, gray and white pencils. I predict this will be in the top three (or it should be). Good luck!', '2007-10-17 23:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177036, 600641, 41675, '<td valign="top">Humorous and creative. The lighting is a bit strong for me, but overall an imaginative photo.</td>', 'Humorous and creative. The lighting is a bit strong for me, but overall an imaginative photo.', '2007-10-17 23:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177046, 601128, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the lighting is a bit harsh, but I like your idea. It shows creativity. I also wonder how it would look with an additional one or two "pencilberries"?</td>', 'For me, the lighting is a bit harsh, but I like your idea. It shows creativity. I also wonder how it would look with an additional one or two "pencilberries"?', '2007-10-17 23:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177051, 600014, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. I do wish your image view was larger. For me, when the images are bigger, they can be more effective to the viewer.</td>', 'I like your idea. I do wish your image view was larger. For me, when the images are bigger, they can be more effective to the viewer.', '2007-10-17 23:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177058, 599609, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) A nice photo. I like his expression. Good setting of the food. The background is a bit busy and distracting for me, but a good photo overall.</td>', ':-) A nice photo. I like his expression. Good setting of the food. The background is a bit busy and distracting for me, but a good photo overall.', '2007-10-17 23:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177059, 599609, 77196, '<td valign="top">Hopefully, graphite and not lead... Always a clown, but never when I''m trying to shoot. This is nice - the white microwave in the background distracts, but as a candid this is great.</td>', 'Hopefully, graphite and not lead... Always a clown, but never when I''m trying to shoot. This is nice - the white microwave in the background distracts, but as a candid this is great.', '2007-10-17 23:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177061, 599069, 41675, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of your image is the reflection. The next thing that catches my eye is the yellow of the pencil and the yellow of the drill. I like it. Clean, simple (and not chopsticks!) Lol. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'My favorite part of your image is the reflection. The next thing that catches my eye is the yellow of the pencil and the yellow of the drill. I like it. Clean, simple (and not chopsticks!) Lol. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-10-17 23:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177069, 601073, 41675, '<td valign="top">Neat image. I like it. A creative and novel idea. Good lighting too.</td>', 'Neat image. I like it. A creative and novel idea. Good lighting too.', '2007-10-17 23:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177071, 599003, 77196, '<td valign="top">Oh! That is subtle - would never have caught it without the title. I just hope voters take the few moments to figure it out. 9</td>', 'Oh! That is subtle - would never have caught it without the title. I just hope voters take the few moments to figure it out. 9', '2007-10-17 23:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177075, 600893, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol. For me, your title adds to the photo. The lighting is a little bit harsh on the top of the apple and the background seems a bit...flat, but overall I like it.</td>', 'Lol. For me, your title adds to the photo. The lighting is a little bit harsh on the top of the apple and the background seems a bit...flat, but overall I like it.', '2007-10-17 23:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177080, 599636, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, it seems a bit washed out. I like the middle and foreground areas of your image. The tray on the right doesn''t add anything and actually distracts my eyes a bit from the rest of your photo. One of the better chopstick entries though.</td>', 'For me, it seems a bit washed out. I like the middle and foreground areas of your image. The tray on the right doesn''t add anything and actually distracts my eyes a bit from the rest of your photo. One of the better chopstick entries though.', '2007-10-17 23:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177081, 600581, 14437, '<td valign="top">This is cool. The shadow is a little disturbing though.</td>', 'This is cool. The shadow is a little disturbing though.', '2007-10-17 23:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177090, 600739, 77196, '<td valign="top">I don''t find the OOF foreground pleasing.</td>', 'I don''t find the OOF foreground pleasing.', '2007-10-17 23:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177091, 600055, 14437, '<td valign="top">The mechanical pencil is out of focus. The overall lighting could be better.</td>', 'The mechanical pencil is out of focus. The overall lighting could be better.', '2007-10-17 23:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177093, 600383, 14437, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the color.</td>', 'I love the composition and the color.', '2007-10-17 23:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177095, 599267, 41675, '<td valign="top">Her bright smile makes me laugh and know she''s having fun with the pencils in her hair. The flash seems a little bit on the bright side to me.</td>', 'Her bright smile makes me laugh and know she''s having fun with the pencils in her hair. The flash seems a little bit on the bright side to me.', '2007-10-17 23:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177100, 599574, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the striped pencils. For me, perhaps if the image was pulled back, and not so close, the idea of chopsticks would work better. That and maybe having more of the fingers rather than just a little bit of them showing - which in some ways is a distracting.</td>', 'I like the striped pencils. For me, perhaps if the image was pulled back, and not so close, the idea of chopsticks would work better. That and maybe having more of the fingers rather than just a little bit of them showing - which in some ways is a distracting.', '2007-10-17 23:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177102, 600076, 14437, '<td valign="top">Wow. This shot does have a wow factor in it. Very creative.</td>', 'Wow. This shot does have a wow factor in it. Very creative.', '2007-10-17 23:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177104, 600581, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, Mr. Tell has been busy this challenge. Lol. I like the closeup angle. I also like how you used a green pencil to match the green on the tomato.</td>', 'Hmmm, Mr. Tell has been busy this challenge. Lol. I like the closeup angle. I also like how you used a green pencil to match the green on the tomato.', '2007-10-17 23:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177107, 601012, 14437, '<td valign="top">The pencil is shaky and not sharp. Artifacts could be seen on the pencil too.</td>', 'The pencil is shaky and not sharp. Artifacts could be seen on the pencil too.', '2007-10-17 23:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177111, 600739, 41675, '<td valign="top">a "bridge" over troubled waters? (Sorry, that song popped into my head when I saw your image). Creative idea and different - which is nice. I like the viewpoint.</td>', 'a "bridge" over troubled waters? (Sorry, that song popped into my head when I saw your image). Creative idea and different - which is nice. I like the viewpoint.', '2007-10-17 23:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177112, 600805, 14437, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. Just that the pencil couldn''t be recognized clearly. I like the lighting though.</td>', 'Nice portrait. Just that the pencil couldn''t be recognized clearly. I like the lighting though.', '2007-10-17 23:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177116, 599328, 77196, '<td valign="top">OK. How''dja do that? Is the grey triangle on the left part of the shadow-making? 9</td>', 'OK. How''dja do that? Is the grey triangle on the left part of the shadow-making? 9', '2007-10-17 23:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177118, 600968, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the black &amp; white. Your border is a bit too thick and detracts my eyes from your focal point, but a creative idea for the challenge all in all.</td>', 'I like the black & white. Your border is a bit too thick and detracts my eyes from your focal point, but a creative idea for the challenge all in all.', '2007-10-17 23:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177123, 601142, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. The colors and gray areas seem a little flat to me. Perhaps if there was more contast or if the pencil was in an ash tray, I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'I like your idea. The colors and gray areas seem a little flat to me. Perhaps if there was more contast or if the pencil was in an ash tray, I would have scored it higher.', '2007-10-17 23:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177128, 600826, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, its the harsh flash which detracts from you image. I like what you did with the pencil as the sword though.</td>', 'For me, its the harsh flash which detracts from you image. I like what you did with the pencil as the sword though.', '2007-10-17 23:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177133, 599966, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, while I like the vibrant colors of your image, it doesn''t communicate the pencils as something other than a pencil as stated in the challenge rules. Sorry. :-|</td>', 'For me, while I like the vibrant colors of your image, it doesn''t communicate the pencils as something other than a pencil as stated in the challenge rules. Sorry. :-|', '2007-10-17 23:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177135, 600723, 41675, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what the pencil is representing...other than a pencil, but i do like the lighting.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what the pencil is representing...other than a pencil, but i do like the lighting.', '2007-10-17 23:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4177139, 601145, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) Lol. I like it. having the other fighter in the background definitely helps your image. Well executed. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', ':-) Lol. I like it. having the other fighter in the background definitely helps your image. Well executed. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-10-17 23:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
