(4177353, 601123, 85156, '<td valign="top">Good original idea.  Don''t love the shadow.  I am not sure if you trying to get  the shadow in the shot or if it''s something that you couldn''t avoid.</td>', 'Good original idea.  Don''t love the shadow.  I am not sure if you trying to get  the shadow in the shot or if it''s something that you couldn''t avoid.', '2007-10-18 01:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
