(4182196, 599158, 81301, '<td valign="top">You have here a beautiful portrait style photo  executed to perfection. Your model is beautiful, and the vest idea is great. The one thing that is not so great (actually kind of messy) is the pencil vest that you have created. <br/>After all, the theme is Pencil(s), and not Portrait, and that is where in my humble opinion, you have dropped the ball. Its always nice to see a beautiful portrait of a beautiful child but with 3 new themes a week, I would have liked to see more attention to the actual theme.</td>', 'You have here a beautiful portrait style photo  executed to perfection. Your model is beautiful, and the vest idea is great. The one thing that is not so great (actually kind of messy) is the pencil vest that you have created. After all, the theme is Pencil(s), and not Portrait, and that is where in my humble opinion, you have dropped the ball. Its always nice to see a beautiful portrait of a beautiful child but with 3 new themes a week, I would have liked to see more attention to the actual theme.', '2007-10-20 02:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4182259, 601017, 54778, '<td valign="top">I probably would have taken out the thumb on the the hammer from the picture.. It''s the only thing the lighting is off on.. the rest makes a nice pic..</td>', 'I probably would have taken out the thumb on the the hammer from the picture.. It''s the only thing the lighting is off on.. the rest makes a nice pic..', '2007-10-20 02:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
