(4182262, 599211, 54778, '<td valign="top">I think the quality lets the pic down.. otherwise the lighting, composition and idea works very well..</td>', 'I think the quality lets the pic down.. otherwise the lighting, composition and idea works very well..', '2007-10-20 02:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
