(4184116, 601123, 81213, '<td valign="top">Cool! 7</td>', 'Cool! 7', '2007-10-21 00:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184118, 598524, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The loighting and colors could be brighter.</td>', 'Great composition. The loighting and colors could be brighter.', '2007-10-21 00:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184121, 600981, 81213, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it?</td>', 'I don''t get it?', '2007-10-21 00:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184122, 600893, 35530, '<td valign="top">Clever title.</td>', 'Clever title.', '2007-10-21 00:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184127, 601051, 35530, '<td valign="top">Best of the chopstick shots so far.</td>', 'Best of the chopstick shots so far.', '2007-10-21 00:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184141, 600945, 81213, '<td valign="top">~<br/>Nothing in this photo is actually in focus, but I love this fill frame idea! If the end of that pencil was in more focus then I may have given this I 9. Great idea!<br/>~</td>', '~Nothing in this photo is actually in focus, but I love this fill frame idea! If the end of that pencil was in more focus then I may have given this I 9. Great idea!~', '2007-10-21 00:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184147, 600681, 81213, '<td valign="top">Impressive. I wish the pencil was in better focus. 6</td>', 'Impressive. I wish the pencil was in better focus. 6', '2007-10-21 00:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184149, 601008, 81213, '<td valign="top">Wow, out of all the chopstick shot''s I''ve seen so far, this is the best! 7</td>', 'Wow, out of all the chopstick shot''s I''ve seen so far, this is the best! 7', '2007-10-21 00:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184151, 601027, 81213, '<td valign="top">I love chaos... 8</td>', 'I love chaos... 8', '2007-10-21 00:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184154, 601019, 81213, '<td valign="top">Dot, dot, dot... 3</td>', 'Dot, dot, dot... 3', '2007-10-21 00:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184160, 599574, 81213, '<td valign="top">I could see this better as a fill frame shot cropped closer at the top... 4</td>', 'I could see this better as a fill frame shot cropped closer at the top... 4', '2007-10-21 00:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184162, 601097, 81213, '<td valign="top">Finally! A photo of someone USING there pencil chopsticks! Thank you, you have prevented me a night of unrest. (Not realy) But I like it. Blue background gives a lot: 8</td>', 'Finally! A photo of someone USING there pencil chopsticks! Thank you, you have prevented me a night of unrest. (Not realy) But I like it. Blue background gives a lot: 8', '2007-10-21 00:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184164, 600191, 81213, '<td valign="top">Over-exposed... 3 Cool idea!</td>', 'Over-exposed... 3 Cool idea!', '2007-10-21 00:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184170, 601202, 81213, '<td valign="top">That''s the same camera I have!</td>', 'That''s the same camera I have!', '2007-10-21 00:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184192, 600893, 81213, '<td valign="top">Amazing! 9</td>', 'Amazing! 9', '2007-10-21 01:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184193, 599003, 81213, '<td valign="top">Nice, 9</td>', 'Nice, 9', '2007-10-21 01:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184195, 600084, 81213, '<td valign="top">Wow! Amazing... 9</td>', 'Wow! Amazing... 9', '2007-10-21 01:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184690, 601051, 78196, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and well presented, let down a little by lack of contrast and flat lighting.</td>', 'Very nice idea and well presented, let down a little by lack of contrast and flat lighting.', '2007-10-21 10:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184693, 600832, 78196, '<td valign="top">I don''t think your use of the pencil is interesting enough for this to score highly. Composition is sound enough.</td>', 'I don''t think your use of the pencil is interesting enough for this to score highly. Composition is sound enough.', '2007-10-21 10:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184696, 600896, 78196, '<td valign="top">Oh very good. Watch your background though, on my (terrible) screen the blackness starts to fade in the bottom left.</td>', 'Oh very good. Watch your background though, on my (terrible) screen the blackness starts to fade in the bottom left.', '2007-10-21 10:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184700, 601128, 78196, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea by any stretch but I think it could have been better executed - the pencil seems totally disconnected from the bush so the effect is lost.</td>', 'Not a bad idea by any stretch but I think it could have been better executed - the pencil seems totally disconnected from the bush so the effect is lost.', '2007-10-21 10:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184705, 601002, 78196, '<td valign="top">I''m slightly confused by your title, presumably there aren''t that many places in bright sunlight at two in the morning?! The idea is an interesting one but I''m not convinced by it andI tihnk the focus is a little off as well (the 1 seems sharper than the pencil).</td>', 'I''m slightly confused by your title, presumably there aren''t that many places in bright sunlight at two in the morning?! The idea is an interesting one but I''m not convinced by it andI tihnk the focus is a little off as well (the 1 seems sharper than the pencil).', '2007-10-21 10:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184707, 598846, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice use of depth of field, the pencil has a nice perspective to it. Lighting a little on the harsh side perhaps and the figure doesn''t really blend in the with the background as well as he might.</td>', 'Nice use of depth of field, the pencil has a nice perspective to it. Lighting a little on the harsh side perhaps and the figure doesn''t really blend in the with the background as well as he might.', '2007-10-21 10:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184709, 600014, 78196, '<td valign="top">Honestly? Too small, too blurry, not executed well enough.</td>', 'Honestly? Too small, too blurry, not executed well enough.', '2007-10-21 10:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184711, 599788, 78196, '<td valign="top">The colours here are quite interesting. All in all quite a pleasant macro that could do with perhaps a narrower DoF to add interest.</td>', 'The colours here are quite interesting. All in all quite a pleasant macro that could do with perhaps a narrower DoF to add interest.', '2007-10-21 10:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184719, 600829, 78196, '<td valign="top">A lovely mess of subtle tones and bokeh. Well composed. However I don''t think many people are going to ''get it''. I suppose the pencil is helping the growth of the plant? Still, you get high marks from me for producing a real bit of photography in a challenge that almost seems designed to remove any artistic flair, emotion or individualism.</td>', 'A lovely mess of subtle tones and bokeh. Well composed. However I don''t think many people are going to ''get it''. I suppose the pencil is helping the growth of the plant? Still, you get high marks from me for producing a real bit of photography in a challenge that almost seems designed to remove any artistic flair, emotion or individualism.', '2007-10-21 10:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184722, 600894, 78196, '<td valign="top">Very good. Colours seem a touch on the faded side I must say (maybe saturation could go up a bit? I don''t think the lighting helps) and this is probably just a touch over-sharpened. Otherwise excellent.</td>', 'Very good. Colours seem a touch on the faded side I must say (maybe saturation could go up a bit? I don''t think the lighting helps) and this is probably just a touch over-sharpened. Otherwise excellent.', '2007-10-21 10:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184728, 601050, 78196, '<td valign="top">Composition a bit off (too much blurred foreground) but I like the colours here. But I don''t understand it for a minute I''m afraid.</td>', 'Composition a bit off (too much blurred foreground) but I like the colours here. But I don''t understand it for a minute I''m afraid.', '2007-10-21 10:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184729, 600828, 78196, '<td valign="top">The colours match well but the white balance is too cool and the spaghetti box would look better in focus.</td>', 'The colours match well but the white balance is too cool and the spaghetti box would look better in focus.', '2007-10-21 10:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4184730, 601172, 78196, '<td valign="top">Top marks for effort but the lighting is very harsh and I feel a better perspective would have helped (Down low from the mouse''s height?)</td>', 'Top marks for effort but the lighting is very harsh and I feel a better perspective would have helped (Down low from the mouse''s height?)', '2007-10-21 10:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
