(4185617, 601171, 45475, '<td valign="top">Still a pencil. You can point with your finger and it would still be your finger. Know what I mean? Just because you''re using it to point, doesn''t mean it''s being communicated as anything other than a pencil. It''s <i>doing</i> something, not <i>being</i> something.</td>', 'Still a pencil. You can point with your finger and it would still be your finger. Know what I mean? Just because you''re using it to point, doesn''t mean it''s being communicated as anything other than a pencil. It''s doing something, not being something.', '2007-10-21 20:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
