(4187196, 600828, 83395, '<td valign="top">neat idea because of the color likeness.  If you boiled it in the pot with the other noodles, I''d be even more convinced.</td>', 'neat idea because of the color likeness.  If you boiled it in the pot with the other noodles, I''d be even more convinced.', '2007-10-22 12:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187226, 599328, 68256, '<td valign="top">I have this rated as my highest entry for the challenge although somehow I doubt it will score well :)  I love the stark B/W and it really meets the challenge well.  I don''t like the weird looking triangle on the left side that is grey though as it really upsets the balance of the photo.</td>', 'I have this rated as my highest entry for the challenge although somehow I doubt it will score well :)  I love the stark B/W and it really meets the challenge well.  I don''t like the weird looking triangle on the left side that is grey though as it really upsets the balance of the photo.', '2007-10-22 12:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187227, 600894, 68256, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully done and must have taken some real effort to get all those shavings!  Great patterns and design.</td>', 'This is beautifully done and must have taken some real effort to get all those shavings!  Great patterns and design.', '2007-10-22 12:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187302, 600812, 59200, '<td valign="top">I love this concept and composition. Although I wish the focus was different. Because the pencil point and the woody''s shoulder are the only things in focus I feel like they are competing with each other.</td>', 'I love this concept and composition. Although I wish the focus was different. Because the pencil point and the woody''s shoulder are the only things in focus I feel like they are competing with each other.', '2007-10-22 13:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187304, 600908, 59200, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get some people saying this doesnt fit the challenge very well but I really like it a lot. It''s different than all the rest.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get some people saying this doesnt fit the challenge very well but I really like it a lot. It''s different than all the rest.', '2007-10-22 13:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187305, 601192, 59200, '<td valign="top">I like the background and am curious how you did it, but I think with this image it probably distracts a bit much from the subject.</td>', 'I like the background and am curious how you did it, but I think with this image it probably distracts a bit much from the subject.', '2007-10-22 13:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187450, 601171, 83313, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of using a Bic pen as a rocketship when I was bored in class. If the subject was "what is this pen?", THEN I would have had an entry for this one.</td>', 'Reminds me of using a Bic pen as a rocketship when I was bored in class. If the subject was "what is this pen?", THEN I would have had an entry for this one.', '2007-10-22 14:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187451, 600945, 83313, '<td valign="top">Way too out of focus, but the idea works.</td>', 'Way too out of focus, but the idea works.', '2007-10-22 14:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187455, 601145, 83313, '<td valign="top">The glove looks a little over-enhanced, ad I think the pencil itself would be better in focus.</td>', 'The glove looks a little over-enhanced, ad I think the pencil itself would be better in focus.', '2007-10-22 14:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187456, 600191, 83313, '<td valign="top">Highlights are alittle blown out, I would have liked to see more texture showing</td>', 'Highlights are alittle blown out, I would have liked to see more texture showing', '2007-10-22 14:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187459, 599574, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great idea and a good shot. Good lighting, DOF and colors.</td>', 'Great idea and a good shot. Good lighting, DOF and colors.', '2007-10-22 14:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187463, 600014, 74975, '<td valign="top">:)</td>', ':)', '2007-10-22 14:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187466, 598846, 83313, '<td valign="top">Sure I got it. Didn''t you get my e-mail in response? I think this could have had some more humor or impact, though I am not quite sure what it needs. Perhaps a slightly changed perspective...</td>', 'Sure I got it. Didn''t you get my e-mail in response? I think this could have had some more humor or impact, though I am not quite sure what it needs. Perhaps a slightly changed perspective...', '2007-10-22 14:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187467, 600076, 83313, '<td valign="top">Know the feeling. A little gruesome, but very well done. Lots of impact.</td>', 'Know the feeling. A little gruesome, but very well done. Lots of impact.', '2007-10-22 14:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187472, 599211, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just seems plain. visible pixellation around the points, and the DOF is too shallow for the subjects.</td>', 'Just seems plain. visible pixellation around the points, and the DOF is too shallow for the subjects.', '2007-10-22 15:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187475, 601012, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Excellent DOF, especially for items so close and so far away.</td>', 'Nice idea. Excellent DOF, especially for items so close and so far away.', '2007-10-22 15:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187477, 600681, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks good. Nice freeze frame.</td>', 'Looks good. Nice freeze frame.', '2007-10-22 15:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187479, 599966, 83313, '<td valign="top">The title says my own comment. It''s what I expected to see a lot of in this challenge, but very well done.</td>', 'The title says my own comment. It''s what I expected to see a lot of in this challenge, but very well done.', '2007-10-22 15:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187488, 600805, 68586, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture.<br/> <br/>Did I just say ''Excellent'' ? <br/> <br/>I meant truly excellent !!<br/> <br/>For my money a clear ribbon winner.</td>', 'Excellent picture. Did I just say ''Excellent'' ?  I meant truly excellent !! For my money a clear ribbon winner.', '2007-10-22 15:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187517, 601236, 55005, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but the light is a bit too harsh and the pencils seem to be arranged in a hurry (some of them show the writing on the pencil, some don''t).</td>', 'I like the idea but the light is a bit too harsh and the pencils seem to be arranged in a hurry (some of them show the writing on the pencil, some don''t).', '2007-10-22 15:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187527, 600641, 55005, '<td valign="top">I wish the second pencil was in focus.</td>', 'I wish the second pencil was in focus.', '2007-10-22 15:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187528, 600790, 55005, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution. Love the colors and that razor-sharp focus is, well, very sharp.  :)</td>', 'Great idea and execution. Love the colors and that razor-sharp focus is, well, very sharp.  :)', '2007-10-22 15:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187538, 599682, 55005, '<td valign="top">Love the title -- it made me laugh!  Love the colors, the hot spots on the top pencil are a bit distracting.  Great job overall!</td>', 'Love the title -- it made me laugh!  Love the colors, the hot spots on the top pencil are a bit distracting.  Great job overall!', '2007-10-22 15:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187542, 600191, 55005, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Don''t care too much for the color -- looks too yellow on my screen.  I wish they were arranged a bit more neatly, so that focus is consistent throughout.</td>', 'Great idea.  Don''t care too much for the color -- looks too yellow on my screen.  I wish they were arranged a bit more neatly, so that focus is consistent throughout.', '2007-10-22 15:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187550, 600581, 55005, '<td valign="top">It should have been an apple instead of the tomato. :) Very creative idea. The light is a bit too harsh and I don''t know if the white background adds anything to this photo.  The water spot on the tomato is a bit distracting.  I wonder if a different angle would have made this photo a bit more interesting.</td>', 'It should have been an apple instead of the tomato. :) Very creative idea. The light is a bit too harsh and I don''t know if the white background adds anything to this photo.  The water spot on the tomato is a bit distracting.  I wonder if a different angle would have made this photo a bit more interesting.', '2007-10-22 15:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187563, 601051, 55005, '<td valign="top">Very creative! The food on the place seems a bit soft (looks like you focused on the background).  Although the image looks too dark, the rice seems a bit too overexposed on my monitor.  I wonder if a different angle (from the top) would have made this a bit stronger of an image.  And not sure if the fortune cookie adds anything to the image. Love, love, love the idea!</td>', 'Very creative! The food on the place seems a bit soft (looks like you focused on the background).  Although the image looks too dark, the rice seems a bit too overexposed on my monitor.  I wonder if a different angle (from the top) would have made this a bit stronger of an image.  And not sure if the fortune cookie adds anything to the image. Love, love, love the idea!', '2007-10-22 15:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187570, 600106, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is funny!  You should have sharpened both ends of the pencil, though!  This probably would benefit from a bit more brightness adjustments, sharper focus and a different background.  :)</td>', 'This is funny!  You should have sharpened both ends of the pencil, though!  This probably would benefit from a bit more brightness adjustments, sharper focus and a different background.  :)', '2007-10-22 15:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187596, 601027, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is funny!  I love the idea!  I find the faucet, the sink filled with water and background a bit distracting.  The pencil seems a bit too soft.  I would have liked to see the composition built around the toothbrush and the toothpaste (and a bit of toothpaste on the brush would have helped, too).</td>', 'This is funny!  I love the idea!  I find the faucet, the sink filled with water and background a bit distracting.  The pencil seems a bit too soft.  I would have liked to see the composition built around the toothbrush and the toothpaste (and a bit of toothpaste on the brush would have helped, too).', '2007-10-22 15:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187601, 600739, 55005, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but the soft foreground and the light in the water are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Interesting idea but the soft foreground and the light in the water are a bit distracting.', '2007-10-22 15:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187608, 599788, 55005, '<td valign="top">Oh, the sharpness of that pencil is simply great! Great composition and colors.</td>', 'Oh, the sharpness of that pencil is simply great! Great composition and colors.', '2007-10-22 15:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187620, 600721, 45475, '<td valign="top">Comical shot and title! A lost pencil is still a pencil though, isn''t it? ;) <br/> <br/>You know what? I''ve come back to bump this up because, well, this is meant to be a fun challenge and you had a bit of fun with it, and the shot made me laugh. Gotta give credit to a dnmc entry when they''re at least memorable! <br/> <br/>Good luck, hope you''re not being torn to shreds too badly there...</td>', 'Comical shot and title! A lost pencil is still a pencil though, isn''t it? ;)  You know what? I''ve come back to bump this up because, well, this is meant to be a fun challenge and you had a bit of fun with it, and the shot made me laugh. Gotta give credit to a dnmc entry when they''re at least memorable!  Good luck, hope you''re not being torn to shreds too badly there...', '2007-10-22 15:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187625, 601073, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is really, really cool. One of my favorites in this challenge.  Great job!</td>', 'This is really, really cool. One of my favorites in this challenge.  Great job!', '2007-10-22 15:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187654, 600438, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good detail and lighting on the glass and pencil, though I''m not a huge fan of the cloth used as background.  Perhaps a single color background would make the shot stand out more, due to simplicity.</td>', 'Good detail and lighting on the glass and pencil, though I''m not a huge fan of the cloth used as background.  Perhaps a single color background would make the shot stand out more, due to simplicity.', '2007-10-22 16:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187655, 601172, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very cute idea!</td>', 'Very cute idea!', '2007-10-22 16:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187659, 600791, 35513, '<td valign="top">The lighting effect given by the pencil really makes this shot stand out!</td>', 'The lighting effect given by the pencil really makes this shot stand out!', '2007-10-22 16:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187661, 600681, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow, great capture of the motion here!</td>', 'Wow, great capture of the motion here!', '2007-10-22 16:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187664, 599182, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp colors and details.</td>', 'Nice sharp colors and details.', '2007-10-22 16:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187665, 600584, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and soft tones.  Good clarity and detail as well.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Nice lighting and soft tones.  Good clarity and detail as well.  Nicely done!', '2007-10-22 16:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187669, 600084, 35513, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this photo, the more I like it :-)  Great use of DOF on this shot.</td>', 'The more I look at this photo, the more I like it :-)  Great use of DOF on this shot.', '2007-10-22 16:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187673, 601097, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and colors on this shot.  Very clean, crisp look.</td>', 'Nice lighting and colors on this shot.  Very clean, crisp look.', '2007-10-22 16:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187686, 600560, 53316, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!!!</td>', 'What a cutie!!!', '2007-10-22 16:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187791, 601192, 38930, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like there''s even lead in the one he''s drawing with.  Nice idea though</td>', 'Doesn''t look like there''s even lead in the one he''s drawing with.  Nice idea though', '2007-10-22 16:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187819, 598783, 55005, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more of the "dinner".  A little less light would have made the flame stand out and might have takes care of the colorcast (the color of your background is somewhat odd).  A black and white version might have looked a bit stronger.</td>', 'I would have liked to see more of the "dinner".  A little less light would have made the flame stand out and might have takes care of the colorcast (the color of your background is somewhat odd).  A black and white version might have looked a bit stronger.', '2007-10-22 16:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187822, 600981, 55005, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here and the dof -- very neat.  The dark spots in the top left corner are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the composition here and the dof -- very neat.  The dark spots in the top left corner are a bit distracting.', '2007-10-22 16:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187827, 600624, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is really funny! Very creative!</td>', 'This is really funny! Very creative!', '2007-10-22 16:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187832, 601131, 55005, '<td valign="top">I love the high contrast balck and white look here.  I really like how the light wraps aroudn the bowl and that there is enought light to bring out the texture in the hands. Well done.</td>', 'I love the high contrast balck and white look here.  I really like how the light wraps aroudn the bowl and that there is enought light to bring out the texture in the hands. Well done.', '2007-10-22 16:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187841, 599609, 55005, '<td valign="top">Fun, fun, fun!  I like the tight crop but not sure where the focus went -- the photo looks quite soft for me.  The abckground is a bit distracting as well as the tray on his right and the dirty table.  Looks like you have fun, though!  :)</td>', 'Fun, fun, fun!  I like the tight crop but not sure where the focus went -- the photo looks quite soft for me.  The abckground is a bit distracting as well as the tray on his right and the dirty table.  Looks like you have fun, though!  :)', '2007-10-22 17:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187852, 599158, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait -- the light and focus on her face are amazing!  I love the idea - very, very creative!  I am not too hot about this thing on her neck, it competes a bit with the pencil vest in my opinion.</td>', 'This is a great portrait -- the light and focus on her face are amazing!  I love the idea - very, very creative!  I am not too hot about this thing on her neck, it competes a bit with the pencil vest in my opinion.', '2007-10-22 17:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
