(4187892, 601086, 45475, '<td valign="top">A pencil that is a pencil.<br/> <br/>Ack, that sounded catty didn''t it? Ok, what I meant was that you''ve taken a shot (and a very good one I should add too) of a pencil being represented to us as a pencil. You''ve done exceptionally well with lighting, dof and composition, but unfortunately failed on the challenge brief which was to communicate as something <i>other than a pencil</i>. Apologies for my initial harshness :)</td>', 'A pencil that is a pencil. Ack, that sounded catty didn''t it? Ok, what I meant was that you''ve taken a shot (and a very good one I should add too) of a pencil being represented to us as a pencil. You''ve done exceptionally well with lighting, dof and composition, but unfortunately failed on the challenge brief which was to communicate as something other than a pencil. Apologies for my initial harshness :)', '2007-10-22 17:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
