(4188859, 601244, 75034, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the Evil Dead dude. Have you seen Evil dead the musical yet a must see for fans of the movie.  <br/> <br/>Now on to the photo. I like the use of light (it looks like a flashlight), it gives off soft tones and casts just the right shadow. The DOF is great with the nose and pencils being in focus and fading out from there. Good outside the box shot. I''ll bet it was fun to do.</td>', 'Nice use of the Evil Dead dude. Have you seen Evil dead the musical yet a must see for fans of the movie.   Now on to the photo. I like the use of light (it looks like a flashlight), it gives off soft tones and casts just the right shadow. The DOF is great with the nose and pencils being in focus and fading out from there. Good outside the box shot. I''ll bet it was fun to do.', '2007-10-23 00:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188866, 599788, 75034, '<td valign="top">Good use of tones and colour in this shot and I like how crisp the focus is.</td>', 'Good use of tones and colour in this shot and I like how crisp the focus is.', '2007-10-23 00:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188870, 600383, 75034, '<td valign="top">Now that''s not only a lunch but you can eat and do your speling corrections at the same time. The shot is nicely set up and I like the angle of it as well.</td>', 'Now that''s not only a lunch but you can eat and do your speling corrections at the same time. The shot is nicely set up and I like the angle of it as well.', '2007-10-23 00:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188877, 601128, 75034, '<td valign="top">Nice I doubt that we will see any repeats with this one. I like your thoughts here, and the set up too. I would offer one thing and that would be to use a reflector and remove the shadows from the left side of your image, it is a little dark, that being said it is creative. Good on you.</td>', 'Nice I doubt that we will see any repeats with this one. I like your thoughts here, and the set up too. I would offer one thing and that would be to use a reflector and remove the shadows from the left side of your image, it is a little dark, that being said it is creative. Good on you.', '2007-10-23 01:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188887, 600681, 75034, '<td valign="top">Nice capture on this one. You have nice movement on the pencil and the colours are good as well.</td>', 'Nice capture on this one. You have nice movement on the pencil and the colours are good as well.', '2007-10-23 01:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188893, 599617, 75034, '<td valign="top">Functional and about the size of a number 2 knitting kneedle I think. I like the tones of the yellows on the red it works well, and the lighting is not over done. Good shot.</td>', 'Functional and about the size of a number 2 knitting kneedle I think. I like the tones of the yellows on the red it works well, and the lighting is not over done. Good shot.', '2007-10-23 01:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
