(4188901, 601036, 75034, '<td valign="top">Awsome DOF. I love that you can see so much detail. It looks like you need to floss a little more though.</td>', 'Awsome DOF. I love that you can see so much detail. It looks like you need to floss a little more though.', '2007-10-23 01:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188905, 601114, 75034, '<td valign="top">This is a better approach then all the other chopstick shots in this challenge it is set apart by the DOF, the angle of the shot and the contrast. Nice work with this one.</td>', 'This is a better approach then all the other chopstick shots in this challenge it is set apart by the DOF, the angle of the shot and the contrast. Nice work with this one.', '2007-10-23 01:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4188916, 599158, 75034, '<td valign="top">This is one that we will only see once in this challenge. It is nice to see something outside the box. You can only stomach so many chopsticks. Did you take the time to arrange the colours or did you just start glueing them on?<br/> <br/>Your model is lovley and her Big Blue Eyes are wonderful. I like the movement in her hair and the lighting set up as well.<br/> <br/>Great shot.</td>', 'This is one that we will only see once in this challenge. It is nice to see something outside the box. You can only stomach so many chopsticks. Did you take the time to arrange the colours or did you just start glueing them on? Your model is lovley and her Big Blue Eyes are wonderful. I like the movement in her hair and the lighting set up as well. Great shot.', '2007-10-23 01:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
