(4188929, 600809, 75034, '<td valign="top">You either had this model laying around and were waiting for the right time to use it or you might just have a little to much time on your hands. Overall I like the idea and the setup but I do think that you could use more light at the top of your image. I like the pencil shahings for the center lines very creative.</td>', 'You either had this model laying around and were waiting for the right time to use it or you might just have a little to much time on your hands. Overall I like the idea and the setup but I do think that you could use more light at the top of your image. I like the pencil shahings for the center lines very creative.', '2007-10-23 01:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
