(4189313, 600893, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is funny.  I like everything abou thtis photo, except for your light.  I think a different light angle would ahev made this much stronger of an image.</td>', 'This is funny.  I like everything abou thtis photo, except for your light.  I think a different light angle would ahev made this much stronger of an image.', '2007-10-23 10:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189316, 601142, 55005, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get this --- if you are going for a cigarette feel, I would have added some smoke coming out of the pencil.  A bit more contrast would have helped too (the image is a bit flat)and would have made those darks stand out more.</td>', 'I don''t quite get this --- if you are going for a cigarette feel, I would have added some smoke coming out of the pencil.  A bit more contrast would have helped too (the image is a bit flat)and would have made those darks stand out more.', '2007-10-23 10:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189319, 600805, 55005, '<td valign="top">Fabulous!  Love the light smoke coming out of the pencil.</td>', 'Fabulous!  Love the light smoke coming out of the pencil.', '2007-10-23 10:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189321, 600978, 55005, '<td valign="top">Your light is a bit too harsh here.  I would have liked to see the flower at a different angle -- the curled up petals in the foreground are a bit distracting.  You background is a bit spotty and does not look white on my monitor, maybe a colored background would have helped this a bit. I would have liked the flower to be surrounded by the pencils (it looks like it is placed behind them) for the "vase" effect. Interesting idea, though.</td>', 'Your light is a bit too harsh here.  I would have liked to see the flower at a different angle -- the curled up petals in the foreground are a bit distracting.  You background is a bit spotty and does not look white on my monitor, maybe a colored background would have helped this a bit. I would have liked the flower to be surrounded by the pencils (it looks like it is placed behind them) for the "vase" effect. Interesting idea, though.', '2007-10-23 10:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189325, 601056, 55005, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea!  I love the composition but I find the colors to be a bit off (at least it looks so on my monitor).  I would have also taken the ring off -- it is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Very cool idea!  I love the composition but I find the colors to be a bit off (at least it looks so on my monitor).  I would have also taken the ring off -- it is a bit distracting.', '2007-10-23 10:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189327, 601086, 55005, '<td valign="top">Your dof is a bit too shallow -- I would have liked to see the tips of all the pencils in focus.  Sharpenning them would have made the image a bit stronger, I think.</td>', 'Your dof is a bit too shallow -- I would have liked to see the tips of all the pencils in focus.  Sharpenning them would have made the image a bit stronger, I think.', '2007-10-23 10:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189348, 600721, 30737, '<td valign="top">I can''t see it either...</td>', 'I can''t see it either...', '2007-10-23 10:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189385, 599887, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is really funny and creative!  One of my favorites in this challenge. Great job!</td>', 'This is really funny and creative!  One of my favorites in this challenge. Great job!', '2007-10-23 11:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189484, 599158, 36981, '<td valign="top">I wish I could give this more than a 10! It''s a beautiful image of a beautiful girl, and a very creative take on the challenge!</td>', 'I wish I could give this more than a 10! It''s a beautiful image of a beautiful girl, and a very creative take on the challenge!', '2007-10-23 11:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189511, 599617, 55005, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot -- the idea, the composition, the choice of colors.  I find it just a bit on a darker side, though, and would have liked to see it a little brighter, I think it will make the image really pop.</td>', 'I like this a lot -- the idea, the composition, the choice of colors.  I find it just a bit on a darker side, though, and would have liked to see it a little brighter, I think it will make the image really pop.', '2007-10-23 12:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189517, 601008, 55005, '<td valign="top">What a fun idea.  Great execution, too.  I would have increased the brightness just to make it pop a bit more. Well done.</td>', 'What a fun idea.  Great execution, too.  I would have increased the brightness just to make it pop a bit more. Well done.', '2007-10-23 12:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189521, 599003, 55005, '<td valign="top">Fun idea!  Just love your background.</td>', 'Fun idea!  Just love your background.', '2007-10-23 12:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189528, 600828, 55005, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea!  I like the composition but find that the light is a bit too harsh. I would have liked to see the pencil hidden a bit between the pasta, so that I have to look for it.  Having it so prominently displayed takes away a bit from the photo, in my opinion.</td>', 'Very creative idea!  I like the composition but find that the light is a bit too harsh. I would have liked to see the pencil hidden a bit between the pasta, so that I have to look for it.  Having it so prominently displayed takes away a bit from the photo, in my opinion.', '2007-10-23 12:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189534, 601017, 55005, '<td valign="top">Did you actually hammer the pencils in or just glued them on top?  Very creative image, definitely one of a kind. The color looks a bit odd on my monitor.  The cut-off finger is a bit distracting, too but I love the light on the hammer.  Well done.</td>', 'Did you actually hammer the pencils in or just glued them on top?  Very creative image, definitely one of a kind. The color looks a bit odd on my monitor.  The cut-off finger is a bit distracting, too but I love the light on the hammer.  Well done.', '2007-10-23 12:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189539, 598846, 55005, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  There are a bit too many distracting reflections on the ogre and I would have liked to see the tip of the pencil in focus.</td>', 'Great idea!  There are a bit too many distracting reflections on the ogre and I would have liked to see the tip of the pencil in focus.', '2007-10-23 12:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189573, 600231, 33672, '<td valign="top">What a great idea! A little sharper and this could''ve ribboned!</td>', 'What a great idea! A little sharper and this could''ve ribboned!', '2007-10-23 12:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189576, 601002, 33672, '<td valign="top">Not much sun at 2am.. At least in my experience...;P Nice comp and idea.</td>', 'Not much sun at 2am.. At least in my experience...;P Nice comp and idea.', '2007-10-23 12:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189577, 601017, 33672, '<td valign="top">Cool concept. Nice lighting.</td>', 'Cool concept. Nice lighting.', '2007-10-23 12:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189578, 600908, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2007-10-23 12:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189582, 601050, 33672, '<td valign="top">Subtle but funny....</td>', 'Subtle but funny....', '2007-10-23 12:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189584, 600951, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very cool Shot! nice comp and rhythm.</td>', 'Very cool Shot! nice comp and rhythm.', '2007-10-23 12:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189739, 600809, 74059, '<td valign="top">Did you really chop up all those pencils? The lighting is a bit harsh on the left side and the right side of the frame is in the dark</td>', 'Did you really chop up all those pencils? The lighting is a bit harsh on the left side and the right side of the frame is in the dark', '2007-10-23 14:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189742, 601241, 74059, '<td valign="top">The composition is great but this shot needs more color.</td>', 'The composition is great but this shot needs more color.', '2007-10-23 14:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189743, 601036, 74059, '<td valign="top">wow..now that''s a close-up!</td>', 'wow..now that''s a close-up!', '2007-10-23 14:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189752, 601123, 74059, '<td valign="top">Really clever, but I wish there weren''t so many distracting shadows.</td>', 'Really clever, but I wish there weren''t so many distracting shadows.', '2007-10-23 14:34:54.000000', NULL, 1);
