(4189869, 600805, 84363, '<td valign="top">Really like the concept.  Composition and balance are great.  The one thing I would like to see is just a tiny bit more smoke.</td>', 'Really like the concept.  Composition and balance are great.  The one thing I would like to see is just a tiny bit more smoke.', '2007-10-23 15:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189877, 600721, 84363, '<td valign="top">How does this have anything to do with a pencil......?  Or with the challenge?  I''m guessing this may have been entered as a joke or something..but I guess we''re not getting it...</td>', 'How does this have anything to do with a pencil......?  Or with the challenge?  I''m guessing this may have been entered as a joke or something..but I guess we''re not getting it...', '2007-10-23 15:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
