(4189896, 600468, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colors, and a clean simple shot.  Some voters may ding you for the wrinkles in the background.  For me, I think shooting this from a different angle (rather than head on) might add a little more interest and perspective.</td>', 'Nice bright colors, and a clean simple shot.  Some voters may ding you for the wrinkles in the background.  For me, I think shooting this from a different angle (rather than head on) might add a little more interest and perspective.', '2007-10-23 16:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189902, 601017, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea and nice lighting!</td>', 'Very creative idea and nice lighting!', '2007-10-23 16:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189906, 600611, 35513, '<td valign="top">Cute and clever idea!</td>', 'Cute and clever idea!', '2007-10-23 16:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189908, 599887, 35513, '<td valign="top">Love this!!  :-)</td>', 'Love this!!  :-)', '2007-10-23 16:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189911, 599617, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good detail, and I like the way the lighting brings out the texture of the yarn.  Good color choice for the yarn too--it really stands out :-)  Was this natural light?</td>', 'Good detail, and I like the way the lighting brings out the texture of the yarn.  Good color choice for the yarn too--it really stands out :-)  Was this natural light?', '2007-10-23 16:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189915, 599158, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I really like the lighting on the model''s face...though it doesn''t seem to carry through to the vest in the same way.  Very creative idea!</td>', 'Nice shot!  I really like the lighting on the model''s face...though it doesn''t seem to carry through to the vest in the same way.  Very creative idea!', '2007-10-23 16:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189923, 600945, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the soft tones of this shot a lot, but I feel like I''d like to see a little more of the pencil in better focus.  Overall, I like the shallow DOF, but this shot would have some serious POP to it if the eraser was solidly in crisp detail.</td>', 'I like the soft tones of this shot a lot, but I feel like I''d like to see a little more of the pencil in better focus.  Overall, I like the shallow DOF, but this shot would have some serious POP to it if the eraser was solidly in crisp detail.', '2007-10-23 16:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189924, 601192, 35513, '<td valign="top">VERY cute!  Love this idea :-)</td>', 'VERY cute!  Love this idea :-)', '2007-10-23 16:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4189927, 600894, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is outstanding!!!  Love the different textures used in this photo....very VERY well done!</td>', 'Wow, this is outstanding!!!  Love the different textures used in this photo....very VERY well done!', '2007-10-23 16:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4190067, 599966, 55005, '<td valign="top">Love the colors here and how they really stand out against the background.  Shadows are a bit too harsh but they almost add another dimention to the image.</td>', 'Love the colors here and how they really stand out against the background.  Shadows are a bit too harsh but they almost add another dimention to the image.', '2007-10-23 17:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4190069, 599104, 55005, '<td valign="top">I am really getting hungry for some sushi!  :) I wish the image was a bit brighter, thgouht and the colors seem to be just a bit off on my monitor.</td>', 'I am really getting hungry for some sushi!  :) I wish the image was a bit brighter, thgouht and the colors seem to be just a bit off on my monitor.', '2007-10-23 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4190071, 600246, 55005, '<td valign="top">Love the b&amp;w here, the image seems a bit soft.  A bit of contrast would have helped, in my opinion.</td>', 'Love the b&w here, the image seems a bit soft.  A bit of contrast would have helped, in my opinion.', '2007-10-23 17:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4190075, 601171, 55005, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love how the red really stands out.  I wish the hands were in focus throughout -- the oof bottom right is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Very nice.  Love how the red really stands out.  I wish the hands were in focus throughout -- the oof bottom right is a bit distracting.', '2007-10-23 17:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4190078, 601114, 55005, '<td valign="top">Love the angle here.  Very nice dof -- it really makes the pencil stand out. Very well done.</td>', 'Love the angle here.  Very nice dof -- it really makes the pencil stand out. Very well done.', '2007-10-23 17:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4190081, 600721, 55005, '<td valign="top">LOL!  This is really funny.  I am sure you are going to get quite a few DNMCs.  :) So, where IS the pencil here? :)</td>', 'LOL!  This is really funny.  I am sure you are going to get quite a few DNMCs.  :) So, where IS the pencil here? :)', '2007-10-23 17:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4190083, 599443, 55005, '<td valign="top">This is really cool and I love the colors going on here but I just wish that the pencils were also in focus. They are a bit oof and it is clashing against the nice and shart peels and the cup.</td>', 'This is really cool and I love the colors going on here but I just wish that the pencils were also in focus. They are a bit oof and it is clashing against the nice and shart peels and the cup.', '2007-10-23 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
