(4190773, 600272, 45475, '<td valign="top">I''m sure an intriguing concept that''s currently niggling away at the outer edges of my ignorant mind... However, until I work out if it''s meant to be a pencil or not, I''ve got to say that a) the lighting isn''t too good here; b) the downward angle probably wasn''t the best idea, and; c) perhaps this set up may have been better suited on a flat/single coloured background, rather than a carpeted/textured floor.<br/> <br/><i>eta:</i> Right, I think I''ve worked it out... the lead is lubricating the carriage wheel, kinda like the pencil is meant to be an oil pump? Can''t believe it''s taken me this long. Warned ya I was ignorant! ;)</td>', 'I''m sure an intriguing concept that''s currently niggling away at the outer edges of my ignorant mind... However, until I work out if it''s meant to be a pencil or not, I''ve got to say that a) the lighting isn''t too good here; b) the downward angle probably wasn''t the best idea, and; c) perhaps this set up may have been better suited on a flat/single coloured background, rather than a carpeted/textured floor. eta: Right, I think I''ve worked it out... the lead is lubricating the carriage wheel, kinda like the pencil is meant to be an oil pump? Can''t believe it''s taken me this long. Warned ya I was ignorant! ;)', '2007-10-23 23:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
