(4191125, 600894, 63812, '<td valign="top">You deserved a ribbon since long, long time ago. Congratulations for this wonderful composition and for the previous also excellent ones. I''m really glad you got it<br/></td>', 'You deserved a ribbon since long, long time ago. Congratulations for this wonderful composition and for the previous also excellent ones. I''m really glad you got it', '2007-10-24 01:29:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191131, 600968, 80058, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by arron_christensen:</b></div><hr/><i> great concept. the focus seems a tad soft, but the hogh contrast could be throwing me off. question-did you know the pencil would have that effect when you burned it, or was that by chance? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes focus was a bit soft by the end of the pencil, reason why I cropped the original idea to the final entry... this shot was pretty much an accident! I was burning it well, so I tried, had to light it up billionsof times as it kept going off by itself! As you can see the lead of it stayed completly there...altho a little bit "toasted" lol</td>', 'Originally posted by arron_christensen: great concept. the focus seems a tad soft, but the hogh contrast could be throwing me off. question-did you know the pencil would have that effect when you burned it, or was that by chance?   Yes focus was a bit soft by the end of the pencil, reason why I cropped the original idea to the final entry... this shot was pretty much an accident! I was burning it well, so I tried, had to light it up billionsof times as it kept going off by itself! As you can see the lead of it stayed completly there...altho a little bit "toasted" lol', '2007-10-24 01:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191132, 600894, 38032, '<td valign="top">Very good to see you on the front page.  Congrats!</td>', 'Very good to see you on the front page.  Congrats!', '2007-10-24 01:30:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191134, 600968, 80058, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LanndonKane:</b></div><hr/><i> One of the better shots in this challenge IMO. Very minimal but quite interesting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I love you!!!! The nicest comment I got!! <br/> <br/>Thank youuuuuuuuuuuu</td>', 'Originally posted by LanndonKane: One of the better shots in this challenge IMO. Very minimal but quite interesting.   I love you!!!! The nicest comment I got!!  Thank youuuuuuuuuuuu', '2007-10-24 01:31:17.000000', NULL, 0),
