(4191141, 599158, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh how I am so not surprised to see this one with its ribbon under it!  I love it when the voters get it so right!   CONGRATULATIONS.   What a gorgeous little girl and such a creative display of the challenge!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh how I am so not surprised to see this one with its ribbon under it!  I love it when the voters get it so right!   CONGRATULATIONS.   What a gorgeous little girl and such a creative display of the challenge! ', '2007-10-24 01:32:28.000000', NULL, 0),
