(4191315, 601073, 61336, '<td valign="top">Great setup. Congrats on the yellow.</td>', 'Great setup. Congrats on the yellow.', '2007-10-24 02:18:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191316, 600191, 61315, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the votes and comments! This is my first entry in these challenges and it has been an interesting experience. The unsharpened wood  pencils have quite a bit of texture when viewed with a macro lens so while the image was not overexposed, using levels and contrast I more or less obliterated the texture. I also added a bright yellow color to simulate the color of honeycomb.<br/> <br/>CJ</td>', 'Thanks for the votes and comments! This is my first entry in these challenges and it has been an interesting experience. The unsharpened wood  pencils have quite a bit of texture when viewed with a macro lens so while the image was not overexposed, using levels and contrast I more or less obliterated the texture. I also added a bright yellow color to simulate the color of honeycomb. CJ', '2007-10-24 02:19:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191319, 600894, 61336, '<td valign="top">Great work, Shez! Congrats on your first ribbon.</td>', 'Great work, Shez! Congrats on your first ribbon.', '2007-10-24 02:21:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191335, 600894, 25355, '<td valign="top">Almost an hour and a half after the results were posted and you''ve got more comments tha were posted during the challenge. (I counted them, then promptly forgot the number...)<br/>  Hearty congratulations, Shez. First ribbon and all. All that hard work paid off!</td>', 'Almost an hour and a half after the results were posted and you''ve got more comments tha were posted during the challenge. (I counted them, then promptly forgot the number...)  Hearty congratulations, Shez. First ribbon and all. All that hard work paid off!', '2007-10-24 02:27:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191337, 601192, 49643, '<td valign="top">The idea was nice with good humor but truly speaking I am quiet surprised by seeing this image in top 10. Because the pencil here looks to be used for drawing which is the basic purpose of using the pencil. I also agree with the comments saying about the background noise.<br/>Anyway congratulations for your high finish :)</td>', 'The idea was nice with good humor but truly speaking I am quiet surprised by seeing this image in top 10. Because the pencil here looks to be used for drawing which is the basic purpose of using the pencil. I also agree with the comments saying about the background noise.Anyway congratulations for your high finish :)', '2007-10-24 02:28:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191355, 600894, 69668, '<td valign="top">A wonderful creation.  Congrst on the ribbon.  So deserved.</td>', 'A wonderful creation.  Congrst on the ribbon.  So deserved.', '2007-10-24 02:34:05.000000', NULL, 0),
