(4191805, 601051, 47852, '<td valign="top">I thought this was the best of all the chopstick shots (by far!)...sad to see it in 25th place.  I guess people just got tired of pencils as chopsticks?  Very well set up, good colors.  A bit more light, especially in that top corner may have been helpful, but as someone else mentioned, you don''t want to blow out the details of the rice.  Great job though, and congrats on the new PB! :)</td>', 'I thought this was the best of all the chopstick shots (by far!)...sad to see it in 25th place.  I guess people just got tired of pencils as chopsticks?  Very well set up, good colors.  A bit more light, especially in that top corner may have been helpful, but as someone else mentioned, you don''t want to blow out the details of the rice.  Great job though, and congrats on the new PB! :)', '2007-10-24 06:53:01.000000', NULL, 0),
