(4192612, 601192, 61125, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bnilesh:</b></div><hr/><i> The idea was nice with good humor but truly speaking I am quiet surprised by seeing this image in top 10. Because the pencil here looks to be used for drawing which is the basic purpose of using the pencil. I also agree with the comments saying about the background noise.<br/>Anyway congratulations for your high finish :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>In my interpretation the previous post has too narrow a point of view. The duality of the pencil allows it to fit the challenge; aside from it being a pencil in its traditional meaning, its also the woody''s hands.<br/> <br/>I agree though, that there is too much noise. <br/> <br/>I love the idea and you definitely portrayed it well!  Congrats on the finish!</td>', 'Originally posted by bnilesh: The idea was nice with good humor but truly speaking I am quiet surprised by seeing this image in top 10. Because the pencil here looks to be used for drawing which is the basic purpose of using the pencil. I also agree with the comments saying about the background noise.Anyway congratulations for your high finish :)   In my interpretation the previous post has too narrow a point of view. The duality of the pencil allows it to fit the challenge; aside from it being a pencil in its traditional meaning, its also the woody''s hands. I agree though, that there is too much noise.  I love the idea and you definitely portrayed it well!  Congrats on the finish!', '2007-10-24 13:11:02.000000', NULL, 0),
