(4196165, 601128, 67697, '<td valign="top">I bet there''s a squirrel there holding up that end of the pencil lol.  Very cute idea!  Love the colors.  Excellent macro!</td>', 'I bet there''s a squirrel there holding up that end of the pencil lol.  Very cute idea!  Love the colors.  Excellent macro!', '2007-10-25 23:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4196312, 600894, 67579, '<td valign="top">Shez - Way to go girl!! Im so happy that you got a ribbon and a well deserved one at that, TWO BIG THUMBS UP!!<br/> <br/>-dave</td>', 'Shez - Way to go girl!! Im so happy that you got a ribbon and a well deserved one at that, TWO BIG THUMBS UP!! -dave', '2007-10-26 00:21:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4196366, 600894, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wowsers Shez!!! I just noticed this, then got to thinking, and had to check, and surprisingly saw this was your first ribbon! Big congrats!! What a cool, creative, well deserving image for the red! WTG girl :-) Enjoy your moment in the limelight, you sure deserve it, and I''m sure there''ll be more to follow :-)</td>', 'Wowsers Shez!!! I just noticed this, then got to thinking, and had to check, and surprisingly saw this was your first ribbon! Big congrats!! What a cool, creative, well deserving image for the red! WTG girl :-) Enjoy your moment in the limelight, you sure deserve it, and I''m sure there''ll be more to follow :-)', '2007-10-26 00:48:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4196520, 599267, 50641, '<td valign="top">Great idea and beautiful model.  Coax her into more posing!</td>', 'Great idea and beautiful model.  Coax her into more posing!', '2007-10-26 01:33:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4196870, 600894, 19982, '<td valign="top">Wow...  167 comments and counting.  Going for the world record!  :-)  Congrats again!</td>', 'Wow...  167 comments and counting.  Going for the world record!  :-)  Congrats again!', '2007-10-26 08:16:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4197189, 600894, 73929, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful capture with beautiful colors and texture!  Now about those pencils for sale...  :)<br/> <br/>Congratulations on a much deserved ribbon!</td>', 'This is a wonderful capture with beautiful colors and texture!  Now about those pencils for sale...  :) Congratulations on a much deserved ribbon!', '2007-10-26 11:16:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4197397, 599158, 68388, '<td valign="top">Smart.</td>', 'Smart.', '2007-10-26 12:51:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198234, 601017, 45631, '<td valign="top">This was my pick to win the challenge.  Glad you got in the top ten. Congratulations.</td>', 'This was my pick to win the challenge.  Glad you got in the top ten. Congratulations.', '2007-10-26 20:05:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198595, 601051, 7810, '<td valign="top">A very creative take on the challenge. Your technicals are right on and the composition works. A very strong image ... well done.</td>', 'A very creative take on the challenge. Your technicals are right on and the composition works. A very strong image ... well done.', '2007-10-26 23:23:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198682, 599261, 60862, '<td valign="top">Hey, that''s pretty creative. :)</td>', 'Hey, that''s pretty creative. :)', '2007-10-27 00:12:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198708, 599267, 60862, '<td valign="top">Fun idea, great smile! :)</td>', 'Fun idea, great smile! :)', '2007-10-27 00:29:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198712, 601128, 60862, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, Don. :)</td>', 'Creative idea, Don. :)', '2007-10-27 00:31:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198716, 601142, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but yeah, the lighting and low contrast don''t help it.  You could use this as a processing exercise - see what you can do about the contrast and sharpness.</td>', 'I like the idea, but yeah, the lighting and low contrast don''t help it.  You could use this as a processing exercise - see what you can do about the contrast and sharpness.', '2007-10-27 00:32:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198718, 601236, 60862, '<td valign="top">Brian, I think this might work better with diffuse lighting instead of straight on.  It also might help to have something showing through the door to give it some depth.  Did you fingers hit random keys as you entered the title, or were you making a self-reference about letters that didn''t fit? :)</td>', 'Brian, I think this might work better with diffuse lighting instead of straight on.  It also might help to have something showing through the door to give it some depth.  Did you fingers hit random keys as you entered the title, or were you making a self-reference about letters that didn''t fit? :)', '2007-10-27 00:34:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198837, 600894, 48228, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the wonderful comments and also the favorites.....</td>', 'Thanks for all the wonderful comments and also the favorites.....', '2007-10-27 01:25:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199384, 599261, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great idea. One hardly notices the pencil among the other perches. I like the partial desat effect. It seems a bit over sharpened to me (the white lines below the pencil, perches, and feeder).</td>', 'Great idea. One hardly notices the pencil among the other perches. I like the partial desat effect. It seems a bit over sharpened to me (the white lines below the pencil, perches, and feeder).', '2007-10-27 12:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199399, 601142, 66384, '<td valign="top">I know you can do better than this, because I''ve seen some of your other work. The whole image seems a bit gray. I think a levels adjustment might help. I like your message. It deserves a bit more effort.</td>', 'I know you can do better than this, because I''ve seen some of your other work. The whole image seems a bit gray. I think a levels adjustment might help. I like your message. It deserves a bit more effort.', '2007-10-27 12:14:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199428, 601051, 61651, '<td valign="top">Don''t take it too badly - yes, there were a lot of pencil/chopsticks in this challenge, but your''s was one of the better takes - the composition is very well done, and I like how the pencils extend past the frame.</td>', 'Don''t take it too badly - yes, there were a lot of pencil/chopsticks in this challenge, but your''s was one of the better takes - the composition is very well done, and I like how the pencils extend past the frame.', '2007-10-27 12:23:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199450, 599267, 61651, '<td valign="top">I thought this was pretty clever and you picked funky-looking pencils to use, which in itself made this shot stand out from the pack.  I took a look at your improved version and it does have more impact - in the eyes and the tones of the face especially.  A really nice portrait - she should model for you often, such a wonderful smile!</td>', 'I thought this was pretty clever and you picked funky-looking pencils to use, which in itself made this shot stand out from the pack.  I took a look at your improved version and it does have more impact - in the eyes and the tones of the face especially.  A really nice portrait - she should model for you often, such a wonderful smile!', '2007-10-27 12:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199543, 600894, 5112, '<td valign="top">Many congratulations, Sherryl, on your very first ribbon!</td>', 'Many congratulations, Sherryl, on your very first ribbon!', '2007-10-27 13:59:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199645, 599158, 78132, '<td valign="top">That is so very clever :) Love this shot....</td>', 'That is so very clever :) Love this shot....', '2007-10-27 16:01:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199665, 601044, 66384, '<td valign="top">Jason, my niece, who posed for my Pencil shot looked through this challenge, and she said this was her favorite. I have to agree that it is truly outstanding. At first glance I thought "huh?". Then I saw how sharp the focus is on the pencil tip. I love the DOF -- the pencil seems to be poking out of my computer screen. The bokeh is lovely.</td>', 'Jason, my niece, who posed for my Pencil shot looked through this challenge, and she said this was her favorite. I have to agree that it is truly outstanding. At first glance I thought "huh?". Then I saw how sharp the focus is on the pencil tip. I love the DOF -- the pencil seems to be poking out of my computer screen. The bokeh is lovely.', '2007-10-27 16:24:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199834, 600894, 31443, '<td valign="top">Wow! Sherryl, way to go girl! Here I am looking into DPC after a loooong absence and you got your first ribbon, so happy for your :) This shot is brilliant and well deserved place among winners.</td>', 'Wow! Sherryl, way to go girl! Here I am looking into DPC after a loooong absence and you got your first ribbon, so happy for your :) This shot is brilliant and well deserved place among winners.', '2007-10-27 18:34:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4201176, 599158, 27482, '<td valign="top">Ouch, must sting a little to put that sweater on if you do it incorrectly :)  Congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Ouch, must sting a little to put that sweater on if you do it incorrectly :)  Congrats on the ribbon!', '2007-10-28 10:15:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4201177, 600894, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wohoo, congrats Sherryl!</td>', 'Wohoo, congrats Sherryl!', '2007-10-28 10:16:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4201178, 601073, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool effect, congrat´s on the ribbon!</td>', 'Cool effect, congrat´s on the ribbon!', '2007-10-28 10:16:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4201724, 600894, 2158, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Sherryl.  This ribbon is long overdue.</td>', 'Congratulations Sherryl.  This ribbon is long overdue.', '2007-10-28 18:18:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4201829, 600894, 43298, '<td valign="top">Yay!! Huge congrats to you!!!!! This is great!!!!</td>', 'Yay!! Huge congrats to you!!!!! This is great!!!!', '2007-10-28 19:28:16.000000', NULL, 0),
