(6791077, 600894, 69008, '<td valign="top">THIS IS ONE OF THE MOST INTERESTING AND CREATIVE IMAGES HERE ON DPC.  I LIKE THAT IT WAS CREATED BY COMING UP WITH AN IDEA, PUTTING THE PIECES IN PLACE, THEN PHOTOGRAPHING IT. IT''S AN ACTUAL SCENE, NOT A COMPUTER CREATION.  <br/> <br/>THERE ARE SO MANY DIFFERENT LITTLE DETAILS IN THIS, WITH ALL THE COLORED PENCIL TRIMMINGS AND THE TEXTURES IN THE WOOD THAT I COULD STUDY IT FOR A WHILE AND NOT GET TIRED OF SEEING IT. <br/> <br/> THANKS FOR SHARING YOUR OUTSTANDING TALENT FOR FINDING SOMETHING GREAT TO SEE IN THE EVERYDAY THINGS AROUND YOU.</td>', 'THIS IS ONE OF THE MOST INTERESTING AND CREATIVE IMAGES HERE ON DPC.  I LIKE THAT IT WAS CREATED BY COMING UP WITH AN IDEA, PUTTING THE PIECES IN PLACE, THEN PHOTOGRAPHING IT. IT''S AN ACTUAL SCENE, NOT A COMPUTER CREATION.   THERE ARE SO MANY DIFFERENT LITTLE DETAILS IN THIS, WITH ALL THE COLORED PENCIL TRIMMINGS AND THE TEXTURES IN THE WOOD THAT I COULD STUDY IT FOR A WHILE AND NOT GET TIRED OF SEEING IT.   THANKS FOR SHARING YOUR OUTSTANDING TALENT FOR FINDING SOMETHING GREAT TO SEE IN THE EVERYDAY THINGS AROUND YOU.', '2012-06-09 13:53:20.000000', NULL, 0),
